	<key>The voice track is empty, so there's nothing to clean up. Turn off Enhance voice to keep the original sound.</key>
	<string>La piste vocale est vide : il n’y a rien à nettoyer. Désactivez Améliorer la voix pour garder le son d’origine.</string>
	<key>The window you're recording closed. Stop when you're ready — the recording keeps going.</key>
